ates on our variable rate debt and a reduced benefit from our interest rate swaps. Loss on extinguishment of debt \u2014 The loss on extinguishment of debt was due to a loss on the debt modification of $14 million and debt issuance costs of $31 million during the fiscal year ended September 27, 2024. 46\n"}
